sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant B as Browser (EJS page)
    participant S as Express server
    participant Q as qr-image
    U->>B: Types text or a link
    B->>S: POST /generate (usertext)
    S->>Q: imageSync(usertext, png)
    Q-->>S: PNG buffer
    S-->>B: Render main.ejs with base64 QR image
    U->>B: Print QR Code (print view shows only the code)
